## 4. Protected Backup

Before performing the ransomware simulation, a clean backup of the test directory was created using Restic.

The backup command used was:

```bash
sudo bash -c 'set -a; source /etc/restic-nextcloud.env; set +a; restic -o s3.connections=1 backup "/var/ncdata/manager/files/Ransomeware-Demo" --tag ransomware-demo-clean'
```

The backup was successfully stored in the Restic repository hosted on BKP01 MinIO.

### Clean Recovery Snapshot

| Item | Result |
|---|---|
| Snapshot ID | `1a006eb0` |
| Host | `app01` |
| Tag | `ransomware-demo-clean` |
| Protected path | `/var/ncdata/manager/files/Ransomeware-Demo` |
